    {
      "id": "pD2g3lbNicq67dU9kTWVY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3067.8000035319583,
      "y": -2057.3492533610847,
      "width": 345.7025701349434,
      "height": 347.87878787878776,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "HI3OPTCHiM75RsM5mPB-v"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 949565756,
      "version": 137,
      "versionNonce": 1517959556,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764876393039,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A Equipe de Suporte Concierge é\ncomposta por especialistas em\nfaturamento e contas da AWS, com\nfoco em contas corporativas. Eles\nauxiliarão você de forma rápida e\neficiente com suas dúvidas sobre\nfaturamento e conta. A Equipe de\nSuporte Concierge está disponível\napenas para o plano de Suporte\nEmpresarial. A Equipe de Suporte\nConcierge não oferece suporte para\nmigração para a AWS nem para\ngerenciamento de aplicações na\nNuvem AWS.",
      "fontSize": 19.878787878787872,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A Equipe de Suporte Concierge é composta por especialistas em faturamento e contas da AWS, com foco em contas corporativas. Eles auxiliarão você de forma rápida e eficiente com suas dúvidas sobre faturamento e conta. A Equipe de Suporte Concierge está disponível apenas para o plano de Suporte Empresarial. A Equipe de Suporte Concierge não oferece suporte para migração para a AWS nem para gerenciamento de aplicações na Nuvem AWS.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "98qXAuwGCX3FylzN7I7BW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2566.2044056278764,
      "y": -1601.8037632067171,
      "width": 920.766083386479,
      "height": 359.85714285714255,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "iLEAbiSpiborSFnRWAunx"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bb9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1512764604,
      "version": 601,
      "versionNonce": 1415820036,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764878005070,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Trade capital expense (CAPEX) for operational expense (OPEX) \n  - Pay On-Demand: don’t own hardware \n  - Reduced Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) & Operational Expense\n(OPEX) \n• Benefit from massive economies of scale \n  - Prices are reduced as AWS is more efficient due to large scale \n• Stop guessing capacity \n  - Scale based on actual measured usage \n• Increase speed and agility \n• Stop spending money running and maintaining data centers \n• Go global in minutes: leverage the AWS global infrastructure",
      "fontSize": 26.17142857142855,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Trade capital expense (CAPEX) for operational expense (OPEX) \n  - Pay On-Demand: don’t own hardware \n  - Reduced Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) & Operational Expense (OPEX) \n• Benefit from massive economies of scale \n  - Prices are reduced as AWS is more efficient due to large scale \n• Stop guessing capacity \n  - Scale based on actual measured usage \n• Increase speed and agility \n• Stop spending money running and maintaining data centers \n• Go global in minutes: leverage the AWS global infrastructure",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
